    "MatrixPartialTrace[mat, n, d] calculates the partial trace of mat over \
the nth subspace, where all subspaces have dimension d.\n\
MatrixPartialTrace[mat, n, {\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(d\), \
\(1\)]\),\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(d\), \(1\)]\),\[Ellipsis]}] calculates the \
partial trace of matrix mat over the nth subspace, where mat is assumed to \
lie in a space constructed as a tensor product of subspaces with dimensions \
{d1,d2,\[Ellipsis]}.", "Documentation" -> None, "OwnValues" -> 
